      "filename": "SRS at 60 -- Ellenton (5227763993).jpg",
      "title": "File:SRS at 60 -- Ellenton (5227763993).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/SRS_at_60_--_Ellenton_%285227763993%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SRS_at_60_--_Ellenton_(5227763993).jpg",
